+When `WorkLeafController::apply_agent_result` receives a `ReviewResult` whose findings are resolved,
+the controller selects the reviewed patch-agent chat and appends a feature-completion confirmation.
+`WorkLeafController::send_message` treats `yes` or `y` as confirmation that closes that feature,
+treats `no` or `n` as a reopen signal, and reopens a closed feature when the user sends additional
+chat to that patch agent. Review results with unresolved findings do not offer the completion
+confirmation; the patch agent remains open for follow-up work.
